      "number": 54,
      "source_text_sha256": "a898f88dd67c0b45875184e6e274054ec06ac80952dae76838655ab949492cbd",
      "lines": [
        "Course Objectives",
        "• Conduct and communicate original research:",
        "1. Propose a novel research idea (this will be an iterative process)",
        "2. Design and execute experiments to support the proposed idea",
        "3. Write a research paper about the project",
        "4. Create an oral presentation about the project"
      ]
